    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d240">

                <pb facs="0605" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg519"/>

                <head>No. 237.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. <persName corresp="#p_GPM1"
                            type="from">Marsh</persName> to Mr. <persName corresp="#p_HF1" type="to"
                            >Fish</persName>.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1873-01-22"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 22, 1873</date>. (Received
                        February 12.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 436.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith a copy
                    and translation of the reply of the minister of foreign affairs to my note of
                    January 7, 1873, to that ministry, reported in my dispatch No. 434, dated
                    January 9, 1873.</p>
                <p>The minister of the interior has published in the official Gazette, and in other
                    Italian journals, a circular addressed to the prefects of the different
                    provinces of the kingdom, prescribing the observance of certain regulations
                    respecting emigration. The instrument is too long for convenient translation and
                    transmission by post in a written form, and I inclose instead a French
                    translation, which I suppose to be official, as printed in the Italic, a French
                    newspaper published at Rome.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName corresp="#p_GPM1">GEORGE P. MARSH</persName>.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d240-a1.xml" xpointer="d240-a1"/>
